<td id="S4.T1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" rowspan="2"><span id="S4.T1.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text">Task</span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" colspan="6">Program Repair (27.8K samples per each representation)</td>
