<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">(a) </span>Pass-rate improvement and error-type distribution over five self-debugging rounds. The overall pass rate climbs from 61.54 % in Round 1 to 88.46 % by Round 5, while syntax errors drop sharply and an increasing share of examples transitions into the <span id="A4.T9.st1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">testcase-pass</span> category. Percentages are shown for each round; blank cells indicate zero occurrences..</figcaption>
</figure>
